title: Found_Jason
---
Lona: Found You!
Jason: AHH—!
Jason: Ow…
Jason: Man. I really thought that was a good spot.
Lona: I guess I’m just better than you.
Jason: You asked me what color an orange was yesterday.
Lona: And you still haven’t answered me.
Jason: …It’s orange.
Lona: Oh.
Lona: Okay, then
Lona: My Turn!
Lona: I'm gonna find the best hiding spot ever.
Jason: Don’t bury yourself again.
Lona: That was ONE time!
Jason: Yeah, and I had to dig you out.
Lona: You didn't have to.
Jason: You were literally yelling for help.
Lona: Okay, whatever!
Lona: Just count!
Jason: Fine, fine.
Jason: One…
===